title: 'Decided: a write-protected root stays write-protected and gets no default folders.'
pid: b534cb5b-81a8-4fba-b56b-00c13df83ed9
body: |2-
  The first version of this build asked every re-pointed root to be
  extended, and the review found it made a search hit editable, drawing
  its content, and left it so after switching back. Only a root that was
  editable is extended. A search hit therefore shows, switched, what a
  search hit for its replacement shows, and nothing a fresh content view
  would add.
